   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Faire + infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "**Faire** + infinitive means «to make someone do something» or «to have something done»: **Je fais réparer ma voiture** (I'm having my car repaired).",
      "You do not say **Je répare ma voiture** if someone else does the repair."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Position of the pronouns",
     "texto": [
      "Pronouns go before **faire**: **Je la fais réparer** (I'm having it repaired). The infinitive does not change."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
